cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below and
  cite the DRL-Cox paper it implements (see "references").
type: software
title: "drl-cox: distributionally robust Cox regression in Python"
abstract: >-
  Python implementation of the Wasserstein distributionally robust Cox
  regression model (DRL-Cox) with classical Cox baselines, censoring-aware
  evaluation metrics, preprocessing utilities and a scikit-learn compatible
  estimator.
authors:
